# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Secrets and proprietary modules — highest priority, never negate these
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Embeds the model decryption key — commercial repo only.
# NB: git has no trailing-comment syntax. A comment after a pattern on the
# same line becomes part of the pattern and silently matches nothing, which
# is exactly how this rule failed to fire the first time it was written.
src/crypt_engine.py
*.lic
*.key
*.pem
.env
.env.local
.env.*

# Real clinic configuration (aggregate outcomes of an identifiable clinic).
# clinic_config.template.json ships instead.
clinic_config.json

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Patient data — nothing derived from a real cycle leaves the machine
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Spreadsheets are how patient rows have historically arrived. Blanket-ignored;
# add a specific negation if you genuinely need to publish a blank template.
*.xlsx
*.xls
*.csv
!data/sample/sample_patients.csv

# Everything the pipeline writes: prediction logs, batch outputs, LLM caches.
# These carry patient-identifying values (ФИО in OPU_table_filled_*.xlsx and
# dt_predictions.csv among others).
results/
dt_analytics_data/
dt_llm_cache/
narrator_qa/results/
*.parquet
*.jsonl
ivf_report_*.pdf

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Trained model weights — the commercial asset, distributed separately
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
*.pt
*.pth
*.joblib
*.pkl
*.npz
*.onnx
*.safetensors
!data/sample/*.pkl
releases/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Python
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
__pycache__/
*.py[cod]
*$py.class
*.so
.Python
build/
dist/
*.egg-info/
.eggs/
.pytest_cache/
.ruff_cache/
.mypy_cache/

# Virtual environments
.venv
venv/
env/
ENV/

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Editors, OS, scratch
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
.ipynb_checkpoints/
*.ipynb_checkpoints
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
*.swo
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
*.log
logs/
*.bak
*.bak_*
